          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses came and recited all the words of this song in the hearing of the people, he and Joshua",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32.44",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Syr Vg: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hoshea",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the son of Nun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when Moses had finished speaking all these words to all Israel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he said to them, “Lay to heart all the words which I enjoin upon you this day, that you may command them to your children, that they may be careful to do all the words of this law. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For it is no trifle for you, but it is your life, and thereby you shall live long in the land which you are going over the Jordan to possess.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
