        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses that very day, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ascend this mountain of the Abarim, Mount Nebo, which is in the land of Moab, opposite Jericho; and view the land of Canaan, which I give to the people of Israel for a possession; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and die on the mountain which you ascend, and be gathered to your people, as Aaron your brother died in Mount Hor and was gathered to his people; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "because you broke faith with me in the midst of the people of Israel at the waters of Meri-bath-kadesh, in the wilderness of Zin; because you did not revere me as holy in the midst of the people of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For you shall see the land before you; but you shall not go there, into the land which I give to the people of Israel.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
